[{"_1":2},"routes/post",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8,"_9":-5,"_10":-5,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22},"post",{"_30":40,"_32":41,"_65":94,"_95":96,"_57":58,"_97":61},"chars",1613,"updated","thumbnail","excerpt","연산자(operator): 연산 기호 예: +, - 피연산자(operand): 연산 대상 예: 3, 5, a, b, \"Hello, World!\" 산술 연산자 +, -, *, /, % 증감 연산자 ++, -- 비교…","html","<h2 id=\"연산자\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#연산자\">연산자</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>연산자(operator): 연산 기호\n<ul>\n<li>예: +, -</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>피연산자(operand): 연산 대상\n<ul>\n<li>예: 3, 5, a, b, \"Hello, World!\"</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"종류\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#종류\">종류</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>산술 연산자\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>+</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>-</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>*</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>/</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>%</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>증감 연산자\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>++</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>--</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>비교 연산자\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>==</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>!=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x3C;</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>></span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x3C;=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>>=</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>논리 연산자\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x26;&#x26;</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>||</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>!</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>대입 연산자\n<ul>\n<li>=, +=, -=, *=, %=</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>삼항 연산자\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>? :</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"문자열-더하기\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#문자열-더하기\">문자열 더하기</a></h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">String result3 </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"a + b = \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result3);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// a + b = 10</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>Java에서 위와같은 문자열 연산이 성립하는 이유\n<ul>\n<li>Java 언어 명세(JLS) 에 따르면, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>+</span></span></code></span> 연산자의 피연산자 중 하나라도 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>String</span></span></code></span> 이면, 그 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>+</span></span></code></span> 는 산술 덧셈이 아니라 문자열 연결(string concatenation)로 동작한다고 정의하고 있다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"연산자-우선순위\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#연산자-우선순위\">연산자 우선순위</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>연산자 우선순위는 기초 수학과 동일하며, 변경하기 위해서는 괄호 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>()</span></span></code></span>를 사용한다.</li>\n<li>실무에서는 괄호 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>()</span></span></code></span>를 사용하여 계산 순서를 명확하고 단순하게 하는 것이 좋다.</li>\n<li>아래 순서는 외울 필요가 없으며 필요한 경우 찾아보면 된다.</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>괄호 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>()</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li>단항 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>++</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>--</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>!</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>~</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>new</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>(type)</span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>산술 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>*</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>/</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>%</span></span></code></span> 우선, 이후 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>+</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>-</span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>Shift 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x3C;&#x3C;</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>>></span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>>>></span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>비교 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x3C;</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x3C;=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>></span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>>=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>instanceof</span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>등식 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>==</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>!=</span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>비트 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x26;</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>^</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>|</span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>논리 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>&#x26;&#x26;</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>||</span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>삼항 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>? :</span></span></code></span>)</li>\n<li>대입 연산자 (예: <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>+=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>-=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>*=</span></span></code></span>, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>%=</span></span></code></span> 등)</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"증감-연산자\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#증감-연산자\">증감 연산자</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"전위-후위-증감연산자\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#전위-후위-증감연산자\">전위, 후위 증감연산자</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>++a</span></span></code></span>\n<ul>\n<li>증감 연산자를 피연산자 앞에 둘 수 있다.</li>\n<li>전위(Prefix) 증감 연산자라고 한다.</li>\n<li>증감 연산이 먼저 수행된 후 나머지 연산을 수행한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, b </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ++</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 결과 a = 2, b = 2</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n</li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>a++</span></span></code></span>\n<ul>\n<li>증감 연산자를 피연산자 뒤에 둘 수 있다.</li>\n<li>후위(Postfix) 증감 연산자라고 한다.</li>\n<li>다른 연산이 먼저 수행된 후 증감 연산을 수행한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, b </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 결과 a = 2, b = 1</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"비교-연산자\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#비교-연산자\">비교 연산자</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"문자열-비교\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#문자열-비교\">문자열 비교</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>문자열이 같은지 비교할때 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>==</span></span></code></span>가 아니라, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>.equals()</span></span></code></span> 메서드를 사용하여 비교해야 한다.</li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>==</span></span></code></span> 사용시 성공할 때도 있지만 실패할 때도 있다.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Comp2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        String str1 </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"문자열1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        String str2 </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"문자열2\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        boolean</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result1 </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">equals</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hello\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 리터럴 비교</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        boolean</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result2 </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> str1.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">equals</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"문자열1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 문자열 변수,